---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal & Privacy Policy | Cookies | D-VIEW Invisible Grills"
  description="Read D-VIEW Solutions privacy policy, terms of service, installation warranties, and cookie usage guidelines for Andhra Pradesh."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.dviewsolutions.com/privacy"
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-xs font-bold text-[#16A34A] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span>Customer Trust & Governance</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          LEGAL, PRIVACY & <span class="text-[#16A34A]">COOKIES</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Clear, transparent policies for homeowners across Andhra Pradesh engaging D-VIEW Solutions for architectural invisible grills and safety installations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        
        {/* Section 1: Privacy Policy */}
        <section id="privacy" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            1. Privacy Policy & Data Handling
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              At D-VIEW Solutions, we respect your privacy. When you use our online site-visit booking form, interactive price calculator, or quick-booking modal, you may enter your name, mobile number, city/locality, approximate balcony dimensions, and installation notes.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>How Form Inputs Are Processed:</strong> All enquiry forms and QR codes on this website operate <strong>locally in your browser</strong>. This website does not store your form entries in a backend website database or transmit them automatically on form submission. Instead, your inputs are used to format a pre-filled WhatsApp message draft to our official helpline (<a href="tel:+916281620716" class="text-[#16A34A] font-bold hover:underline">+91 62816 20716</a>) and generate a local on-device QR code. Your enquiry details are shared with D-VIEW only when you choose to press <strong>Send</strong> in WhatsApp, place a direct phone call, or send an email.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Zero Third-Party Lead Resale:</strong> Once you contact us via WhatsApp, phone (<a href="tel:+916281620716" class="text-[#16A34A] font-bold hover:underline">+91 62816 20716</a>), or email (<a href="mailto:dviewsolutions32@gmail.com" class="text-[#16A34A] font-bold hover:underline">dviewsolutions32@gmail.com</a>), your contact details are used solely to coordinate your doorstep measurement visit, prepare your quotation, and support your installation where service is confirmed. D-VIEW currently coordinates services in Bengaluru and is planning expansion into Andhra Pradesh. We do not sell, lease, or distribute your contact information to third-party marketing lists.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section 2: 5-Year Warranty & Legal Terms */}
        <section id="legal" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            2. Legal Terms & 5-Year Warranty Policy
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              Invisible grill installations carried out by D-VIEW come with a <strong>5-Year Warranty</strong>; specific coverage, material options (SS-316 / SS-304), service obligations, and maintenance conditions are confirmed in the written quotation provided prior to installation.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Stainless Steel Wire Cables:</strong> SS-316 or SS-304 options selected based on customer choice and site requirements.</li>
              <li><strong>Structural Fasteners & Tracks:</strong> Installed using structural aluminum track extrusions and matching anchor hardware.</li>
              <li><strong>Written Quotation Terms:</strong> Detailed scope, exclusions, and warranty terms are issued with each individual quotation.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section 3: Cookie Policy */}
        <section id="cookies" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            3. Cookies, Browser Storage & Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              Our website is designed to minimize data collection during browsing:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>In-Memory Page State Only:</strong> Your selected city hub, calculator dimensions, and draft form inputs are held temporarily in your browser tab memory while you browse and are cleared when you close or refresh the page.</li>
              <li><strong>No Behavioural Ad Pixels on Site:</strong> This website does not set cross-site behavioural advertising cookies or third-party tracking pixels in your browser.</li>
              <li><strong>External Resources & Links:</strong> Pages load web typography from Google Fonts (<code>fonts.googleapis.com</code> / <code>fonts.gstatic.com</code>). Clicking a WhatsApp link or scanning an enquiry QR code opens WhatsApp (<code>wa.me</code>), which is governed by WhatsApp's own privacy policy and terms.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
              You can restrict or clear cookies and site data at any time via your browser settings without affecting core browsing capabilities on our site.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Contact Info Box */}
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-slate-900">Have Questions or Need Official Documents?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Our compliance and customer relations desk is always ready to assist you.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a href="tel:+916281620716" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white border border-emerald-300 text-slate-900 font-bold text-xs hover:bg-emerald-50 transition">
              📞 +91 62816 20716
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:dviewsolutions32@gmail.com" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#16A34A] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">
              ✉️ Email Legal Desk
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
